mazelib-rs-tx
=============

This is a Rust port (transpilation) of mazelib, a Python library for
generating and solving mazes:

    https://github.com/john-science/mazelib
    revision 56cd88294a36746bbd324c2c9f7e4ab26095deb3 (mazelib 0.9.17)

The port was produced by reading and translating the original source, so it
is a derivative work of mazelib. mazelib's license applies:

